{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1793750367199391001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"unglacial-shoddy-rail","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":0,"unsigned":2},"authorship_ledger":[],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1793746676014894001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"5ef40622-3050-4526-a901-f3e91ed2f74e","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"b48a-0ffe-4f9c-4b28"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\n\n`tests/unit/test_changed_criteria.py` starts the CLI as the bare command `rebar` (lines 55, 248, 366: `[\"rebar\", \"criteria\", \"eval\", ...]`). The subprocess therefore runs whichever `rebar` comes first on `PATH`, not the build under test. On a host where `~/.local/bin` (a pipx install) precedes the worktree venv, 11 of the module's 18 tests fail with a traceback from `.../pipx/venvs/nava-rebar/.../rebar/cli.py`. With `.venv/bin` first on `PATH` all 18 pass.\n\nObserved 2026-11-03 (session a85e3cd3) in a fresh `make worktree` checkout at `0dac5fa5a33` by running `.venv/bin/pytest -p no:xdist tests/unit/test_changed_criteria.py` without activating the venv: 11 failed, 7 passed. The same command with `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\"` gave 18 passed. CI passes because its runner has no other `rebar` on `PATH`.\n\n## Hypotheses (unproven)\n\n- Other modules that call the CLI by its bare name have the same dependence; nobody has surveyed this yet.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] `tests/unit/test_changed_criteria.py` runs the CLI under test regardless of `PATH` order (for example `[sys.executable, \"-m\", \"rebar\", ...]`), and passes when a different `rebar` comes first on `PATH`.\n- [ ] A regression check fails when a test subprocess starts the CLI by the bare name `rebar`.","env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"f7d2-b08f-e104-45de","ticket_type":"bug","title":"test_changed_criteria runs PATH's rebar, not the build","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["e94f3f89-03cb-428e-85fb-09e94d8940f8","5ef40622-3050-4526-a901-f3e91ed2f74e"]},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1793750367199391001,"uuid":"1d05f93e-785d-437d-9db7-34e1ce1c463d"}